    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Deceptively spacious town property situated at this most convenient location in Dungarvan town, a stones throw from all town amenities, Schools, Shops, Church, Restaurants & Bars, The Waterford Greenway all within five minutes walk from the doorstep. Extended to the rear which accommodates a bright airy kitchen on the ground floor and spacious bathroom on the first floor. Surprisingly spacious accommodation includes, entrance hall, open plan living room/dining room, kitchen, utility, Wc., three bedrooms and bathroom. A secure rear yard with access from the side street completes this ideal town house End of terrace like this one at this great location is an ideal choice for a range of potential purchasers. \r\nThis house must be viewed to be appreciated.\r\n\r\nViewing Strictly by Appointment."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Ground Floor: \r\n\r\nEntrance Hall: 4.3m x 1m (14' 1\" x 3' 2\") \r\nThis hallway creates a bright and airy welcoming atmosphere to the home boasting high ceilings, laminate floor covering, centre lighting.\r\n\r\nLiving Room/Dining Room: 6.4m x 3.6m (20' 9\" x 11' 8\") \r\nCharming open plan sitting/living room/dining room that combines two rooms with arched joining brining light into both spaces from the front and rear of the property.\r\n\r\n•\tLiving Room: 3.6m x 3.4m (11' 8\" x 11' 2\") \r\nThis room is situated to the front of the house and features a solid fuel stove set in a fireplace with cast inset, stone hearth and timber surround, window blinds, fitted with Laminate flooring, window blinds, centre light under centre rose, and TV point.\r\n\r\n•\tDining/Living Room: 3.6m x 3m (11' 2\" x 9' 8\") \r\nThis room opens from the front living room, ideal for a dining and living space and close to the kitchen which is situated at the rear of the ground floor.\r\n\r\n\r\nKitchen: 5.5m x 2.4m (18' 1\" x 7' 8\")\r\nFeaturing a bright sun filled kitchen, with solid timber fitted kitchen, including double oven cooker, extractor fan, ceramic floor tiles, centre lighting, door to side yard and secure access to the side street.\r\n\r\nRear Utility: 1.6m x 1m (5' 2\" x 3' 2\")\r\nSmartly fitted currently holding the Oil fired boiler, plumbed for toilet so can be converted into downstairs WC.\r\n\r\n\r\nFirst Floor: \r\n\r\nLanding: 4.7m x 2.1m (15' 4\" x 6' 8\")\r\nCovered with carpet flooring, centre lighting, smoke alarm. \r\n\r\nBedroom 1: 4.1m x 2.4m (13' 4\" x 7' 8\")\r\nLaminate flooring, centre lighting.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2: 2.8m x 2.4m (9' 2\" x 7' 8\")\r\nSpacious double bedroom featuring built in wardrobes, carpet floor covering, Venetian window blinds, centre lighting. \r\n\r\nBedroom 3: 3m x 2m (9' 8\" x 6' 5\")\r\nSpacious double bedroom featuring built in wardrobes, carpet floor covering, Venetian window blinds, centre lighting. \r\n\r\nMain Bathroom: 2.2m x 1.5m (7' 2\" x 4' 9\") \r\nSpacious bathroom with Wc, whb, vinyl floor covering and centre lighting.\r\n\r\nShower room: 2.3m x 1.8m (7' 5\" x 5' 9\") \r\nCorner shower unit with Triton electric shower fitted, ceramic wall tiles, ceramic floor tiles, centre lighting."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Included :\r\n\r\n•\tLight fittings.\r\n•\tFloor coverings.\r\n•\tFixtures and fittings.                                                                                           \r\n\r\nGeneral features;\r\n\r\n•\tExcellent location five minutes from the centre of Dungarvan town.\r\n•\tWalking distance to all town amenities.\r\n•\tFive minutes cycle to The Waterford Greenway.\r\n•\tFive minutes walk to Dungarvan Shopping Centre.\r\n•\tFive minutes walk to Dungarvan Quayside, and Grattan Square with all the restaurants and Bars.\r\n•\tTen minutes drive to Clonea beach.\r\n•\tExtension to the rear accommodating kitchen, bathroom.\r\n•\tGood condition throughout and well maintained by the current owners.\r\n•\tRear secure yard with access from the side street.\r\n•\tCompletely repainted and well presented by the current owners.\r\n•\tLow maintenance property with small front garden and rear yard.\r\n•\tPVC double glazed windows throughout.\r\n•\tPVC front and rear doors."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: F"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "From The Dungarvan Square proceed up Mary Street to St. Marys Church, turning right at the T-junction at the St. Marys Church, along this Street for 100 metres and turn right onto Mitchell Terrace, proceed for approximately 100 metres and see No. 1 Mitchell Street on the right side, see the DNG Morrissey Properties sign at the front of the house."
      }
    ],
